## Why This Is Asked

This question probes practical on-device multilingual verification, a real-world CRM concern when summaries are generated by LLMs.

## Key Concepts

- Cross-lingual semantic similarity
- Lightweight multilingual models (ONNX/TF-Lite)
- Back-translation checks and drift heuristics
- Privacy-first, on-device inference, staged rollout

## Code Example

```javascript
function fidelity(source, summary, lang) {
  const sim = crossLingualSim(source, summary, lang);
  const back = backTranslate(summary, lang);
  const drift = compare(source, back);
  return { score: combine(sim, drift), explanation: driftReason(drift) };
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How to set fidelity thresholds for different languages?
- How would you evaluate bias or overfitting across languages?

